Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.48,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,151)}Nostalgic Suitcase
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a rare sight to behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've to keep my room clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been easy for mum, if you did the same thing everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna enjoy playing with Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} till sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} is going to bake Pancake for me, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,An idea! I'll ask her to bake one for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But make sure you clean up the room, while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She should have been here by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pancake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll eat the snack-time Dorayaki I have kept away, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother! Is that you, Ken bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
